                "avatar": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/0.png",
                "pinned": true,
                "content": "👋 **Welcome to the server!**\n\nThis is an example server template managed with `discord-sync-cli`.\n\n**Getting Started:**\n> 1️⃣ Check out our <#0> channel to read the rules.\n> 2️⃣ Head over to general chat to say hello.\n> 3️⃣ Visit our support channel if you need technical assistance.\n\nEnjoy your stay! ✨\n\nhttps://dummyimage.com/1200x300/1e293b/38bdf8.png&text=WELCOME+TO+THE+SERVER",
