            "messages": [
              {
                "username": "🛡️ Community Safety",
                "pinned": true,
                "content": "📜 **COMMUNITY RULES**\n\nPlease follow these guidelines to keep our space welcoming and safe for everyone:\n\n> 1️⃣ 🤝 **Mutual Respect**: Zero tolerance for toxicity, insults, harassment, or hate speech.\n> 2️⃣ 🚫 **No Spam**: Do not send unsolicited advertising, mass mentions, or DM promotions.\n> 3️⃣ 🎯 **Keep Topics Relevant**: Keep discussions in their appropriate channels.\n> 4️⃣ ⚠️ **Security First**: Sharing malicious files, exploit payloads, or personal info is strictly prohibited.\n> 5️⃣ 🔞 **No NSFW Content**: Not permitted anywhere in public channels.\n\n👮 **Staff reserves the right to apply moderation actions in case of rule violations.**\n\nhttps://dummyimage.com/1200x300/0f172a/22c55e.png&text=SERVER+RULES",
                "embeds": []
              }
            ],
